WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The last time you were here
I believe was

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
right before
last year's Golden Globes.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.137 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I wished you lucked
and then it worked.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
You were the good luck charm.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You won.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because of you
that happened.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.309 size:78% position:39%
-Thank you very much.
-Thank you very much.

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:10.610
Well, 'cause you didn't thank me
during your speech

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I wanted to make sure
you remember.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:12.946 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I wanted to do it here live
right to your face

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:16.850
and look right in your eyes and
say, thank you, Seth.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is better.
This is better.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:19.486 line:92%
-It's more meaningful this way.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Since
"People Versus O.J. Simpson,"

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.522 line:92%
which was -- from last year

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.858
one of the most special moments
in television,

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.293 size:84% position:42%
have you -- have people
approached you more?

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
Has that performance --
-Yeah.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.431
I think "American Horror Story"
is a more niche thing

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the O.J. thing
had a wider net.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:34.034 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.268
-But not as much -- not as
far-reaching as I thought

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.937
because I was on the phone
the other day in the airport,

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a very nice girl
came up to me

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
and tapped me on the shoulder,
and said,

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.043 line:92%
"I don't want to interrupt you."

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.676 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And of course I thought,

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.046 size:75% position:38%
"Well, then don't --
don't interrupt me."

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:46.546 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.181
And she said, "I just wanted to
give you this."

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was
a little cocktail napkin.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
I looked down
and it said,

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hi, Ms. Foy. I think
you're the greatest actress."

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"She thinks I'm Claire Foy."

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:59.759
I was like, my career is not --
the needle hasn't moved at all.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:01.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Nobody knows who I am.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:02.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, Claire Foy
is very talented.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.465
-Sure. And also, much younger
than I am, so I'll take it.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, take those napkins.
-Yeah.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:07.867 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I took the napkin.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When life gives you
that gift of a napkin...

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I actually went to her and I
was like, "Did you --

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:12.405 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Do you want to save this

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
for when you do run into
Claire Foy?"

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she's like,
"No, you can keep it."

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.610
And so I kept it.
I thought it would be a good --

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.545 line:92%
-You should have written on one,

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:19.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm a huge fan of yours,
Sarah Paulson,"

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
And gave it to her and said,
"this is for Claire Foy."

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Give this to her next time.
-When you ever meet her.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.285 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, exactly.

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.320 line:92%
-So, this -- "The Post" is --

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:30.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is one of those fantastic
films about journalism,

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.424 line:92%
and it's very timely now.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.994
It's about very earlier '70s and
The Washington Post's decision

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.629 line:92%
to publish the Pentagon papers.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:37.430 line:92%
-Yes, because our government

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
was not operating from a place
of full transparency.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, it's weird.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so weird
that it's relevant now.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it totally came back.
-It's strange.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.206 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-That came back around.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:48.808
-Yeah, that's somehow full
circle and here we are again.

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:52.045
-You had read Katharine Graham's
autobiography.

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:53.346 line:92%
-Yes, called "Personal History,"

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I was about 26 years old,
and I tried to option it.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.385 size:88% position:44%
They were not interested
in letting me have it.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I was pretty well-versed
about her and her life,

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.257 line:92%
and she's an incredible woman.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
First woman on the Fortune 500
list to, you know --

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.528 line:92%
C.E.O., it was just incredible.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:09.229 line:92%
And was it a fantastic --

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
it must have been a fantastic
thing to be part of.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you know,
it's Steven Spielberg.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, when you get that call
you're sort of going,

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:19.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Do I do it, do I not do it?
It's Steven Spielberg."

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.641 size:75% position:38%
And then it's, like,
it's also Tom Hanks.

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:24.177
You play his wife,
and some lady named Meryl Streep

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's at the beginning
of her career

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's just starting out
for her.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:28.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're not sure
where it's gonna go.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:32.318
-Well, still you can always say
you were in her first movie.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.486 line:92%
-I was in her first movie.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.420 line:92%
And I think -- I can tell you

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I think things
are gonna go well for her.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask about
"American Horror Story."

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, this is --
How many now have you done?

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've done seven seasons.
-Seven seasons.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.266 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:50.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This season you had one of
the more normal looks

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
you've had on the shows.
Is that a safe --

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, that's a safe thing
to say.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:54.841 line:92%
Yeah, normal being that --

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:56.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you kind of
look like yourself

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.011 line:92%
'cause these are previous years.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:03:00.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is -- Is this Coven?
-This is Coven.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:00.947 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's just an acid-burn
face look,

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:03.216 line:92%
if anyone is interested in that.

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:05.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, totally normal.
-Totally normal.

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:07.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is --
-Hotel.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, Hotel.
-That's Sally the junkie.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:10.190 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sally, the junkie.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.991
This is really the coup de gras
right there.

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:13.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's
the two-headed gal.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:14.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:17.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you got cast as both,
which is --

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:18.064 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I got to play both,

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:21.834
although a lot of people do come
up to me now and they're like,

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.303 line:92%
"Where's your other head?"

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I'm like...

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:27.273 size:84% position:42%
-"That was Claire Foy."
-"That was Claire Foy."

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:27.774 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:29.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
This look was actually
a scary look

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:30.944
because I would actually go out
after work --

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:33.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which one? Oh, yeah.
-After work I would forget --

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
People think this is a wig.
It ain't.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:36.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-That's my hair.

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:37.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow. I definitely thought
it was a wig.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:40.486
-Yeah, yeah, I had to basically
shave it off when it was over

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:41.287 line:92%
because it was so damaged.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I would go to
buy milk at the store

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:44.290 line:92%
at the end of the work day,

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they would, like, drop
my change into my hand,

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:48.761 line:92%
they didn't want to touch me.

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:49.295 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:50.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
I forgot that
I looked like that.

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:52.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"What is going on?"

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You, also --
I'm very excited about this --

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:55.902 size:78% position:39% line:92%
"Oceans 8" is coming.

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.837
-It's coming, and I think --
Yeah, the trailer's coming.

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:00.607
-The trailer's coming very soon.
This is very exciting.

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:01.608 line:92%
And one of your cast members --

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:03.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
this is a fantastic cast --
Sandra Bullock.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Cate Blanchett,
Mindy Kaling, Anne Hathaway.

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:08.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We talked about it last time
you were here though.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:08.881 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Rihanna is in the film.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:11.384
-Yeah, just, also, someone at
the beginning of their career.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're not sure
what she's capable of.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:18.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you and I both share
a low-level, perfectly legal,

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:23.663 size:84% position:42%
obsession with Rihanna.
-Yeah. And, uh, yeah.

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:24.831 line:92%
She texted me not long after.

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:27.000 size:75% position:38%
I got a text message
from Rihanna, yeah.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was convinced
that there was no --

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:31.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
She sent me like,
a crying/laughing emoji

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:33.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
congratulating me
on winning the Golden Globe.

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:36.075
And I was like, "Rihanna's
not gonna send an emoji.

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:37.076 line:92%
She's not sending an emoji."

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I went to set
the next day.

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like,
"Yes, that was me."

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:41.514 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:42.815
-And I thought,
"I can't believe she texted me."

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:45.585
I haven't heard from her
in a long time, I will say.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:46.686 line:92%
-Gotcha. Well, of course not.

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:48.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
She congratulated you
and you iced her.

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:49.756 line:92%
-Yeah, because I was like,

00:04:49.756 --> 00:04:51.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm not writing back
to this girl

00:04:51.591 --> 00:04:52.792 line:92%
who's pretending to be Rihanna.

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:54.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm totally not going
to do that."

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:57.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I do think I have
a little bit of a connection

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you want me to see
if I can't try to get her

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:00.933 size:78% position:39% line:92%
to come on your show.

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.603 size:84% position:42%
-Look, I don't think
that's going to happen.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.470 line:92%
But I will take an emoji.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just get me --
Sarah, get me an emoji.

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:08.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I will get
an emoji from Rihanna.

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:11.311
-Even if she has to send it
to you and you forward it to me.

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:13.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It should be like,
"This is for Seth."

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:14.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, this emoji.

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:17.216
-Or she'll send me an emoji
and I'll craft something

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:18.518 line:92%
that's like, "Give this to Seth"

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it won't really be
from Rihanna.

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:21.521 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That will be from me.

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:23.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll take anything --
-From Rihanna.

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
She also sends me
some fenti goodies

00:05:25.758 --> 00:05:26.793 line:92%
every once in awhile, too.

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:29.162 size:88% position:44%
-Your life is fantastic.
-It's pretty cool, yeah.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:32.365
-How do they -- how -- When
Rihanna sends you something,

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:33.433 line:92%
does it come via regular mail?

00:05:33.433 --> 00:05:35.401 size:78% position:39%
-It, like, comes down
in a giant unicorn

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:37.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
with billowing hair
and diamonds and things.

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:38.971 line:92%
-There's, like, smoke machines.

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:40.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's, like, a poof and,
like, a wind,

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.242 size:84% position:42%
and you're like, "Ahhh"
and it's your UPS guy.

00:05:43.242 --> 00:05:45.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
The UPS guy does not wear
normal clothing

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:46.379 size:88% position:44% line:92%
when he delivers things.

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:49.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The UPS guy delivers it
and then he explodes.

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:49.749 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Then he explodes, yeah.

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:51.684
He's like,
"I think this is from Rihanna."

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:54.721 size:84% position:42%
-He's like, "If this is
how I'm go, I'm happy."

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Anyone would go this way."
It's true.

00:05:56.923 --> 00:06:00.226
-So I want that too.
I want an emoji and just one --

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:02.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You want an exploding UPS guy
to hand you

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:06.933
a really exciting thing of fenti
sandals with faux fur on them.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:08.501 line:92%
-Golden Globes, Spielberg movie,

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:10.002 line:92%
seven years of "Horror Story."

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.204 line:92%
None of that means anything --

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:13.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
None of it's as cool
as an emoji from Rihanna.

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:15.975
-I'm going to get text messages
from you now

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
more frequently
than I already do.

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:18.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always such a delight
to have you.

00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:23.916 line:92%
Sarah Paulson, everybody.

